  First off: how do you get unholy water (short of wishing for it)?  Is there
  any way?  I'd like to be able to curse things occasionally (like genocide
  scrolls, etc) and right now, the only ways I know are to be attacked by
  Liches, Nagas or the Wizard (a bad idea for other reasons) or to dip them 
  in fountains (*extremely* rare... Usually it'll get erased...).

  One thing I'd like to be able to curse consistently will be revealed after
  much blank space as it is a spoiler.






















  The Bell of Opening, when cursed, produces wraiths, zombies and other undead
  types when (a)pplied.  So, with your wand of undead turning, you can get an
  infinite number of wraith and edible giant corpses and thus have a (more or
  less) undefeatable character upon completing your Class Quest.

